---
// src/pages/my-ballot.astro
//
// The former My Ballot landing page promoted the Candidates voter guide with
// two CTAs and a full explainer. That guide was parked on 2026-08-19: it
// serves 2026 primary results with roughly 201 of 360 contests structurally
// defective and carries no under-construction treatment. See
// docs/current_status_candidates_page.md.
//
// The route is kept rather than deleted so existing bookmarks, printed QR
// codes, and search results do not 404. The previous page content is in git
// history at b492fcb if it is ever restored.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base
  title="My Ballot | The Wyoming Opposition"
  description="The Wyoming candidate directory is being rebuilt. Join the Wyoming Opposition for the record, with links to original sources."
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="bg-wy-bone min-h-[70vh] pt-28 pb-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-wy-sandstone font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sm mb-3">Under Construction</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif font-extrabold text-wy-charcoal mb-6 leading-tight">
        My Ballot is being rebuilt.
      </h1>

      <div class="bg-white border-l-4 border-wy-sandstone rounded-sm p-6 mb-8">
        <p class="text-wy-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
          The candidate directory carried results from the 2026 primary. We found enough problems in
          how those results were matched to candidates that we would rather show you nothing than
          show you something wrong. It is offline until it can be rebuilt and checked.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-wy-charcoal/80 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
        That standard is the point. If we ask Harriet Hageman and Chuck Gray to answer for their
        record, we have to be willing to correct our own.
      </p>
      <p class="text-wy-charcoal/80 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
        When it returns it will be sourced, checked, and honest about what it does not know.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a
          href="/pulse"
          class="bg-wy-ember text-wy-bone font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-sm text-lg tracking-wide hover:bg-wy-ember-dark transition-colors shadow-sm text-center"
        >
          Join the Wyoming Opposition
        </a>
        <a
          href="/"
          class="border-2 border-wy-charcoal text-wy-charcoal font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-sm text-lg tracking-wide hover:bg-wy-charcoal hover:text-wy-bone transition-colors text-center"
        >
          Back to the front page
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>
